# Tomb Raider I-III Remastered (PPSA16901): default-launch route past the EULA gate.
#
# The title opens on a 40-page EULA and holds there indefinitely. Cross is inert
# until the last page is reached: pulses at pages 1 and 32 both left the frame
# byte-identical (run02, 2026-08-26). Down auto-repeats -- three 2 s holds moved
# 1/40 -> 32/40 -- so one long hold walks to 40/40, after which Cross accepts.
6-14:down
16-18:cross
20-22:cross
26-28:cross
32-34:cross
